%% STATUS: TARGET (proposed, not implemented). Callback queue only. No live transfer exists.
sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Caller
  participant API as Calls API
  participant EM as Escalation manager
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant Q as Support queue UI
  actor R as Support representative
  participant AU as Audit log
  C->>API: Asks for a person
  API->>EM: Create escalation, reason human_request
  EM->>EM: Assign priority by policy
  EM->>DB: Insert escalation and first event
  API-->>C: Honest message, callback offered, no live transfer claimed
  C->>API: Gives callback number
  API->>DB: Store contact in restricted column
  R->>Q: Opens queue
  Q->>API: GET /api/escalations with staff session
  API->>API: Check role and organization
  API->>DB: Query scoped to organization
  API-->>Q: Open escalations
  R->>Q: Claims item and opens transcript
  Q->>API: PATCH assign, GET transcript
  API->>AU: Record assignment and transcript access
  API-->>Q: Summary and transcript
  R->>C: Calls back outside this system
  R->>Q: Records outcome
  Q->>API: PATCH status resolved
  API->>DB: Insert escalation event
  API->>AU: Record resolution
